2. LICENSE GRANT

(a) Trial Use

The Software is made publicly available for download and evaluation. Upon
installation, the User is granted a temporary, non-exclusive right to use the
Software for a Trial Period of 30 days to evaluate its functionality.

(b) Commercial Use

To continue using the Software after the Trial Period, the User must purchase a
valid license from the Authors (via https://oduist.com).

(c) Perpetual & Irrevocable Status

Once a valid license is purchased, the grant is perpetual and irrevocable,
subject to compliance with the terms of this agreement. The license is strictly
tied to the Odoo Instance in which it was purchased.

